1
00:00:00,167 --> 00:00:04,933
Rp4.106 triliun.
Anggaran terbesar dalam sejarah.

2
00:00:04,933 --> 00:00:09,433
Tapi ada satu baris
yang jarang dibaca: bunga.

3
00:00:09,767 --> 00:00:14,367
Pendapatan: Rp3.435,10 T.

4
00:00:14,367 --> 00:00:18,433
Belanja: Rp4.106,26 T.

5
00:00:18,433 --> 00:00:24,167
Defisit: Rp671,16 T
(2,4% PDB).

6
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:30,000
Keseimbangan primer:
-Rp20,85 triliun.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,933
Tanpa bunga,
anggarannya nyaris seimbang.

8
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:41,733
Sisanya: bunga.
Sekitar Rp650 triliun.

9
00:00:41,733 --> 00:00:45,867
18,9% dari pendapatan negara.

10
00:00:45,867 --> 00:00:49,033
Rp1,78 triliun sehari.

11
00:00:49,367 --> 00:00:52,533
Pendidikan: Rp824 triliun.

12
00:00:52,533 --> 00:00:55,700
Bunga setara 79% dari itu.

13
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:59,567
Dibayar sebelum program dimulai.

14
00:00:59,933 --> 00:01:05,333
Sumber: UU APBN 2027,
disahkan 29 September 2026.

15
00:01:05,333 --> 00:01:11,500
Bunga: hitungan sendiri
(defisit - keseimbangan primer).

16
00:01:11,867 --> 00:01:15,767
Defisit bisa diperdebatkan.

17
00:01:15,767 --> 00:01:17,500
Bunga tidak.
